sls-local is an independent, local implementation of the public HTTP API of Alibaba Cloud Simple
Log Service (SLS), meant for development and testing: SLS clients and collectors (SDKs,
LoongCollector) write to it and SLS data sources (such as nethinwei-sls-datasource for Grafana)
query it, without a cloud account.

This project is not affiliated with, sponsored or endorsed by Alibaba Cloud. Alibaba Cloud,
Aliyun, Simple Log Service and SLS are trademarks of Alibaba Group. They are used here only to
describe what this software is compatible with. sls-local is not a replacement for the SLS
service and makes no claim to match its behavior in every respect; see docs/wire-findings.md for
the known differences.

The implementation was written from the public API documentation, the open-source SLS SDKs and
LoongCollector, and the observable behavior of the service when used through its public API. It
contains no code of the SLS service. Error messages that clients rely on to recognize an error
are reproduced verbatim for compatibility.

